notes=("Kept all five old kinds. Archetypes added for Unidyne 55, SM57, SM58, SM7, RE20, MD 421, MD 441, D12, U 47, U 67, U 87, C12, C414, KM 84, C451, RCA 44, RCA 77-DX, Coles 4038, M 160, R-121; old WA47/WA87/KM 184/Super 55/SM7B/SM7dB/MD 421 Kompakt/RE20 became versions. "
 "Wireless kept tier-only (5 models + 10 ranges); dropped Galaxy Audio CSL4, Samson XPD2m, Audix Novacore, Airwave AT-5000 and several duplicate ranges as long-tail SKUs. Dropped ranges Vocaster, 50 Series, SM (LDC), evolution Wired (LDC) as noise. "
 "Left out for lack of a retrieved confirming page: KM 184 year (1994 only in search snippets), WA-44 as RCA 44 clone, Schoeps CMC, Neumann CMV 3, Beyerdynamic M 88 type, R-121 Live, XLS/XLII years (sources disagree). Sweetwater InSync, AudioTechnology (403) and MusicTech (503) were blocked and not retried.")
